119.seo_schema:
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "@id": "https://dsdproperties.in/blog/dakhil-kharij-lucknow-mutation-process-guide-hindi#faq-1",
      "name": "Dakhil Kharij kya hai aur ise Naamantaran kyun kehte hain?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Dakhil Kharij sarkari jameen record update karne ki kanooni prakriya hai. Dakhil matlab naye maalik ka naam darj karna, Kharij matlab purane maalik ka naam hatana. Ise Naamantaran ya Mutation bhi kehte hain. Lucknow aur UP mein ye UP Revenue Code 2006 ki Dhara 34 ke tahat hoti hai. Tehsildar rural land ke liye, LDA apne allotted properties ke liye, aur LMC urban non-LDA properties ke liye administer karte hain."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "@id": "https://dsdproperties.in/blog/dakhil-kharij-lucknow-mutation-process-guide-hindi#faq-2",
      "name": "Kya registry ke baad Dakhil Kharij karana zaruri hai?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Haan practically mandatory hai. Registry se sale legally valid ho jati hai lekin bina Dakhil Kharij ke purana maalik hi Khatauni aur Property Tax records mein dikhta rehta hai. Home Loan refinancing block hoti hai, utility transfer mushkil hota hai, future resale rukti hai, aur NHAI-UPSIDA acquisition mein compensation bhi purane maalik ko mil sakti hai. Registry ke 30-45 din baad mutation karvayen."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "@id": "https://dsdproperties.in/blog/dakhil-kharij-lucknow-mutation-process-guide-hindi#faq-3",
      "name": "Lucknow mein Dakhil Kharij mein kitna samay lagta hai?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Rural land ke liye standard timeline 15-30 din hai. 2025 ke naye niyamon ke anusaar gair-vivadit cases mein 30 din mein nipatana anivarya kar diya gaya hai. Complex cases mein objections ke karan 90 din tak bhi lag sakte hain. LDA mutations 30-60 din mein, LMC urban mutations 15-30 din mein. Registry ke 30-45 din baad filing ideal hai."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "@id": "https://dsdproperties.in/blog/dakhil-kharij-lucknow-mutation-process-guide-hindi#faq-4",
      "name": "UP mein Dakhil Kharij ki fees kitni hai?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Property value par depend karti hai - Rs 200 se Rs 2,500 tak. 5 lakh se kam ki property par Rs 200, 5-10 lakh par Rs 500, 10 lakh se zyada par Rs 1,000-2,500. Total kharcha document cost aur optional lawyer fee milakar Rs 2,000-6,000 aata hai. LDA transfer fees scheme-specific hain. Payment UPI, Net Banking, Debit-Credit Card se accept hoti hai."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "@id": "https://dsdproperties.in/blog/dakhil-kharij-lucknow-mutation-process-guide-hindi#faq-5",
      "name": "Kya Dakhil Kharij online ho sakta hai?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Haan rural aur agricultural land ke liye vaad.up.gov.in par online application hoti hai - ye UP sarkar ka official Revenue Court Management System hai. Mobile OTP se login karein, registry number aur date daalein, documents upload karein, fee pay karein. Amar Ujala ki report ke anusaar nayi RCCMS vyavastha mein registry ke samay hi naamantaran vaad automatically daayar ho jata hai. LDA properties ke liye LDA office mein apply karein."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "@id": "https://dsdproperties.in/blog/dakhil-kharij-lucknow-mutation-process-guide-hindi#faq-6",
      "name": "Registry aur Dakhil Kharij mein kya fark hai?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Registry Sub-Registrar Office par IGRSUP ke through hoti hai - 7% stamp duty + 1% registration = 8% kharcha - aur registered Sale Deed issue hoti hai. Dakhil Kharij ek administrative follow-up hai jo Khatauni aur LDA-LMC records ko update karti hai. Dono zaruri hain. Registry sale hui prove karti hai, mutation ab maalik kaun reflect karti hai. Banks aur future buyers Khatauni record hi check karte hain."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "@id": "https://dsdproperties.in/blog/dakhil-kharij-lucknow-mutation-process-guide-hindi#faq-7",
      "name": "Virasat ke mamle mein kya documents chahiye?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "2025 mein UP ne prakriya saral ki hai. Ab sirf (1) mrityu pramaan patra, (2) uttaradhikariyon ka pehchaan patra Aadhaar, (3) vanshavali Lekhpal ya Gram Pradhan se certified, (4) agar ek naam par mutation hai to baaki heirs ka NOC, (5) purani Khatauni, (6) rishte ka shapathpatra chahiye. Pehle jaruri shapathpatra aur Gram Panchayat report hata di gayi hai."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "@id": "https://dsdproperties.in/blog/dakhil-kharij-lucknow-mutation-process-guide-hindi#faq-8",
      "name": "Kya Dakhil Kharij na hone par Bank Loan ruk jata hai?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Haan zyadatar banks aur housing finance companies home loan sanction karne se pehle Khatauni ya municipal record mein applicant ko current owner ke roop mein demand karte hain. Mutation pending hai to Khatauni mein purana maalik dikhta hai, mismatch create hota hai, aur loan rejection ya delays hote hain. Ye Lucknow mein property loans rukne ka sabse common kaaran hai."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "@id": "https://dsdproperties.in/blog/dakhil-kharij-lucknow-mutation-process-guide-hindi#faq-9",
      "name": "2025 mein Dakhil Kharij mein kya naye badlav hue hain?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "2025 mein UP sarkar ne kai ahem badlav kiye hain: (1) gair-vivadit Dakhil Kharij ko 30 dino mein nipatana anivarya, (2) virasat prakriya saral - sirf mrityu pramaan patra aur varison ka pehchaan patra kafi, pehle jaruri shapathpatra aur Gram Panchayat report hata di gayi, (3) vivadit jameen par automatic rok - maamla seedhe SDM ya Revenue Court mein, (4) Online status tracking sabhi districts mein, (5) Bhulekh aur Bhumi Samadhan portal integration."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "@id": "https://dsdproperties.in/blog/dakhil-kharij-lucknow-mutation-process-guide-hindi#faq-10",
      "name": "Status kaise check karein ki Dakhil Kharij hua ya nahi?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "vaad.up.gov.in par jaakar mobile number se OTP login karein. Registry number aur date daalein. Status screen par aa jayega - Pending, Lekhpal verification, Tehsildar approval, ya Complete. Khatauni update check karne ke liye upbhulekh.gov.in par District Lucknow select karein, Tehsil choose karein, village name aur Khasra number daalein. Agar 90 din baad bhi status pending hai to concerned Tehsildar office se follow-up karein."
